WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.285
In 1784,

2
00:00:01.285 --> 00:00:03.491
Kant summed up an age

3
00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:05.137
in two words.

4
00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:06.215
Sapere aude.

5
00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:07.647
Dare to know.

6
00:00:07.973 --> 00:00:10.366
Kant said Enlightenment is leaving

7
00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:12.238
self-imposed immaturity.

8
00:00:12.238 --> 00:00:14.067
Thinking for yourself.

9
00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:16.124
Voltaire for tolerance.

10
00:00:16.124 --> 00:00:18.385
Rousseau for the general will.

11
00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.302
Montesquieu for the separation of

12
00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:21.264
powers.

13
00:00:21.595 --> 00:00:23.669
From here came liberalism,

14
00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:24.451
and later,

15
00:00:24.451 --> 00:00:25.611
socialism.

16
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.137
Your turn.

17
00:00:27.137 --> 00:00:29.264
Who's associated with it?
